<p>
  {dgettext("help_commands", "Stops keeping a message in view.")}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_code}>{dgettext("help_commands", "Syntax")}</.help_h4>
<pre>{dgettext("help_commands", "/unpin <message id>")}</pre>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_tag}>{dgettext("help_commands", "Parameters")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <code>message id</code>
  {dgettext("help_commands", "— The number of a message this channel is keeping.")}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_tab_control}>{dgettext("help_commands", "How It Works")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_commands",
    "The message itself stays exactly where it is in the conversation — only the pin goes. The Pinned window unpins from the entry too, which is usually where you are when you decide to."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_lock}>{dgettext("help_commands", "Who can")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_commands",
    "Channel operators and owners, the same as pinning. Unpinning a message nothing was keeping is not an error — it says so and changes nothing."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_lightbulb}>{dgettext("help_commands", "Examples")}</.help_h4>
<pre>{dgettext("help_commands", "/unpin 1284")}</pre>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help_commands", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <.help_link topic="cmd-pin">{dgettext("help_commands", "/pin")}</.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="ui-pinned-window">{dgettext("help_commands", "Pinned Window")}</.help_link>
</p>
